From 7b09d7c44b91177f82b038a354a14c55dd122606 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:18:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(swarmagents): board rejects submit_task_work for
 unpushed branches (t97)

submit_task_work now validates gitBranch (non-empty, not main/master, must
start with feat/|fix/|docs/) and optionally verifies the ref exists on origin
via git ls-remote, gated by SWARM_GIT_REMOTE_CHECK=0 (disabled in tests).
Invalid branches return a clear JSON-RPC -32602 error. Adds branch-check.ts
with an injectable git runner, unit tests for branch-check and the handler,
and documents the push-before-submit rule in the README worker section.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
