 5. **Submit** — `tools/call` `submit_task_work` with `{taskId, gitBranch,
    summary, prUrl?}`. Persistence is atomic; a write failure surfaces as a
-   JSON-RPC `-32603` error, never as a false success.
+   JSON-RPC `-32603` error, never as a false success. The board requires
+   `gitBranch` to be a pushed branch named `feat/<slug>`, `fix/<slug>` or
+   `docs/<slug>` (never `main`/`master`). Workers must `git push -u origin <branch>`
